  "description": "A high-performance, pure C# shimmer and skeleton-loading library for .NET Android. Features AutoSkeleton (turns existing TextViews/ImageViews into placeholders automatically), PorterDuff content-aware masking, synchronized multi-view sweeping with a shared shader (ShimmerGroup), Loading/Content/Error state transitions with a built-in retry view, ShimmerRecyclerView, ShimmerTextView/ShimmerImageView, code-built presets, automatic dark mode, and reduced-motion support. 100% C#, no Java/Kotlin bindings required. .NET 10/11 compatible, trim-safe, AOT-compatible.",
